<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's Engil hits high for 1996.</title>
<headline>Portugal's Engil hits high for 1996.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese construction firm Engil-SGPS hit a high for 1996 of 1,575 escudos on the Lisbon bourse as investors encouraged by prospects for the company bought the stock heavily, dealers said.</p>
<p>&quot;The strong interest in Engil returned and took the share to a new high,&quot; one operator said. &quot;It could rise above 1,600 escudos in the short term.&quot;</p>
<p>After hitting the high, Engil eased to 1,569 escudos, up four, in volume of 203,400 shares at 1345 GMT.</p>
<p>-- Paula Cordeiro, Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
